# Wallies up a wall: at most combo.wallridesPerAir (2) wallrides in one air. Beside the lab wall,
# ollie, I: wallride; ollie off it (a wallie) and I at once: a second wallride on the same wall;
# wallie again and I mashed every 3 ticks: no third. It lands from 1.55 m, Wallride + Wallride =
# 504. (Each catch used to give at least 0.5 m/s up and there was no limit: wallride, wallie,
# wallride... climbed past the 3 m wall top, 12 wallrides in one air.)
park lab
cmd 0 teleport -27.3 -9 0.14 0
hold up 6..90
hold ollie 80..100
tap grind 104
hold ollie 105..125
tap grind 126
hold ollie 127..147
tap grind 150..300 every 3
run 500
expect event wallrideStart count == 2
expect event wallrideEnd{reason=ollie} count == 2
expect max skater.pos.z < 1.6 over 100..400
expect event land within 262..266
expect event comboLanded{name=Wallride + Wallride,points=504,multiplier=2} within 273..277
expect no event bail
